d smooth performance, perfect for home entertainment, home theater, business use, and more.<br>\u25cf\u00a0Speak into the voice remote control, you can quickly access entertainment, get answers, and control devices around your home with Google Assistant.<br>\u25cf\u00a0Easily cast photos, videos, and music from your phone, tablet, or laptop to your TV with Chromecast built-in. Enjoy the big-screen entertainment.<br>\u25cf\u00a0Supports HDR10+, HDR10, HLG HDR processing, witness scenes, and characters come to\u00a0life in vivid contrast, color, and clarity.<br>\u25cfGoogle certified ATV Player, built-in streaming media content such as Youtube, Prime video, Google play.<br>\u25cfSupport regular automatic upgrades.</span></p>\n<p><strong><span data-spm-anchor-id=\"a2g0o.detail.1000023.i1.224c370alujZrW\"><br></span></strong></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/HspDrg5Z-kZZ-Ldk0GVhVYzFM08wOaEsH45liWN7q_DykLFdzc2m8oDZ1kdnmNjn2GfNG43p-XUq31GnC2eB1fceG2L4RHwS1P-9I8m62zIrQQ2WgtukRsDgYl8nDeNl4aD9Zut3_mv4TU3Mgc7dpThFyplScb-I8LrO_4GulmZpgG_j8GGXRSLLmf32WHmnIfvkd4wRae-A-FCted6Rn2q-kvGC86BpIWlGnk_nOv4ot_EigbixBuKU-J9VPUvM9e6xPDCpndB6h4YY3kerXmjxyrDMNHLQMLRUtx2SaiBwtNwciKV17tcCY1CWLfEo4lbXSH36oyAKYWpocQznsq_JsL2vFkIrYcyNxrWIWwlNJ0o-y6w-vK4QEtGwn6uZU9ar075nv2sWCbT0IQYnS_bCWPFvpXQnpexmgHjZD5JHOHYxM-doAzC0AM3IGSdH6uaZcRhdn3S581pp4LYA9ku7scJUZNjMj9GtW4h-Ig5IqEhKHdNwrXCQB9WPMJzsNPM1sz33sytdTRebvkHxKUcPgxipHqxVisu_g280d1JQ5j77tj5I1ZsGEA95ogTohznBcLQpnebTxxTt7r6gbSh2uxzFM9vmqkHb5qcYyRU9y6aupc_90Q_FVMaojSkzqaRInxFHs-ipN70rvrpAist6cvEG9f30r5VflwIea-83_U3T9cNiuMupNjgB5nUPlSE9isZ8gBZWqhWFqr034FmC=s929-no?authuser=1\"><img src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/cJImjK3_PoAdtreGlVVoOgJhSO59a9y-C50eT0zUQV4Bm3spWmo0IZ6TzDymi5uF129ZCZpgisjlIXoDjWWuoY9Tr9vZRTcFZFLxjtpNaJvIPD9FagRhU3KwKX1zboFa5Gl47lFnm_7uVtLebgltF1YkY1mXsJNcFCCqpQ5pKtlPeddDonsv9Epi6fGq-N3LRdmPJDnilhdEwtJ_ony9XJOhtfHqHGCzhP50Fyb68fxO4TfyS2lRvBsKsLqylbWSW1mbtfQoMNmrWMhWAczrgr6-zPxAmAWV_fgnzu7rAWGKWyb7rfUVCYiE17SA_a